47
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,879
And Zhang Xiaodong's death
is one of their works.

48
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,560
But I don't get it:

49
00:03:59,479 --> 00:04:00,479
Why would the killer

50
