175
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,240
Watch the building's exterior!

176
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,440
Observe suspicious floors!

177
00:11:11,639 --> 00:11:12,440
Understood!

178
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:16,679
Liang,

179
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:18,200
