199
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,120
Dropped into hot oil alive?

200
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:04,259
(Longfan)
Both wrists show

201
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:05,799
(Longfan)
obvious circular bruising,

202
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:08,320
