and a dark purple color,

203
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:10,360
and slight epidermal peeling.

204
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,919
He was tied up long before he died?

205
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:14,320
Yes.

206
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:16,799
Also, in the deeper layers
of the bruising,

207
00:12:16,799 --> 00:12:18,519
