215
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,519
It's injury from a high fall.

216
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,480
Rooftop.

217
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,480
Check there now.

218
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,320
Got it.

219
00:12:39,933 --> 00:12:41,450
