whether you're just a witness

289
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:27,399
or an accomplice to murder!

290
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:29,000
I've said it countless times!

291
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,120
My boss is dead. I'm very sad!

292
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:31,600
But you...

293
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:32,519
Chen Xiaolong!

294
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,519
Since your boss is dead,

295
00:15:35,519 --> 00:15:37,320
will those people let you go?

296
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,559
You're a smart guy.

297
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:42,279
Use your brain!

298
00:15:42,279 --> 00:15:43,159
Cooperate with us,

299
00:15:43,159 --> 00:15:44,840
or end up like your boss?

300
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:57,799
Fine.

301
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,039
I'll talk.

302
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:03,799
Roughly a hundred victims.

303
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:06,320
I just do odd jobs to make a living.

304
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,159
We're really clueless

305
00:16:09,679 --> 00:16:10,960
about how big his business was.

306
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,519
Keep talking!

307
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:14,240
We mainly targeted women,

308
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:18,799
or those with female family members.

309
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,039
We'd pretend to be nice guys

310
00:16:21,879 --> 00:16:23,360
and lure them in with low interest.

311
00:16:23,559 --> 00:16:25,159
When they couldn't pay,

312
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,200
we'd use...

313
00:16:29,919 --> 00:16:31,559
nude photos and videos
to blackmail them.

314
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,120
Qin, skipping home again?

315
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:45,200
To save his life,

316
00:16:45,279 --> 00:16:46,559
Chen Xiaolong spilled.

317
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,919
These guys are real scumbags.

318
00:16:48,919 --> 00:16:50,120
They bleed you dry.

319
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:51,559
I visited the victims.

320
00:16:51,679 --> 00:16:52,720
After nine years,

321
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:53,799
some of them

322
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:56,360
are still afraid to go out at night.

323
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,600
Some still tremble at the mention

324
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,399
of Good Luck Hot Pot.

325
00:16:59,519 --> 00:17:01,720
Liu Sanhao's shadow
still hangs over them.

326
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,200
Does this mean

327
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:06,920
the Executer

328
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:09,960
was one of Sanhao Finance's victims?

329
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,720
The current evidence doesn't show a link

330
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:14,920
between Liu Sanhao and the Executer.

331
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:16,680
Let's go.

332
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:18,400
Check out the scene.

333
00:17:32,079 --> 00:17:33,599
This is the waitress.

334
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,440
Tell us the details.

335
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:34,960
Okay.

336
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:35,759
This way, please.

337
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:38,359
She sat right here,

338
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,920
ordered extra spicy Chongqing hot pot.

339
00:17:40,279 --> 00:17:42,200
Few people order extra spicy,

340
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,480
so I remember her.

341
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,799
After she left,

342
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:46,200
our boss glanced at the leftover broth

343
00:17:46,519 --> 00:17:47,440
and turned pale.

344
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,240
He even personally dumped it.

345
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:51,200
Is this the woman?

346
00:17:56,620 --> 00:18:00,653
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

347
00:18:01,210 --> 00:18:05,360
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

348
00:18:05,533 --> 00:18:09,210
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

349
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:13,786
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

350
00:18:22,826 --> 00:18:26,500
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

351
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:29,220
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

352
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:33,960
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

353
00:18:34,026 --> 00:18:37,780
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

354
00:18:38,106 --> 00:18:42,380
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

355
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:46,760
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

356
00:18:47,853 --> 00:18:51,040
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

357
00:18:51,813 --> 00:18:55,700
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

358
00:19:04,690 --> 00:19:08,480
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

359
00:19:08,893 --> 00:19:12,770
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

360
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:16,680
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

361
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:19,690
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

362
00:19:19,746 --> 00:19:24,410
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

363
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:28,760
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

364
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:31,530
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

365
00:19:31,586 --> 00:19:33,330
♪We stop here in this night♪

366
00:19:33,626 --> 00:19:38,020
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

367
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:43,813
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

368
00:19:46,666 --> 00:19:52,340
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

369
00:20:04,253 --> 00:20:07,170
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

370
00:20:07,170 --> 00:20:11,746
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

371
00:20:13,466 --> 00:20:19,120
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪
